Task: grpc-tests (22/30, track lrocore_20260909)

Created packages/lro/tests/test_grpc.py — 11 tests over TestGetOperation,
TestWaitOperation, TestRegistration.

Red verified: ModuleNotFoundError on alis.build.lro.grpc.

Registration is asserted against a fake registrar that records what it was
given, because grpc.Server does not expose its registered handlers. The
assertion is on the service name, so registering the wrong service would fail.

The servicer under test is configured with a 10ms poll, so the two wait tests
finish well under a second rather than sleeping the 1s production default.

The missing-extra import guard cannot be exercised while grpcio is installed;
scripts/check_bare_core.py covers it in P6, which is where the other packages
assert the same thing.
